v40_f_with_icon	windows: reads the executable's version information with PowerShell
v40_g1_specials	windows: reads the executable's version information with PowerShell
v40_g5_gt_in_name	windows: reads the executable's version information with PowerShell
v40_g7_utf8_in_name	windows: reads the executable's version information with PowerShell
v40_g8_amp_in_comments	windows: reads the executable's version information with PowerShell
v40_h3_leading_zeros	windows: reads the executable's version information with PowerShell
v40_h6_largest	windows: reads the executable's version information with PowerShell
v40_i_places	windows: reads the executable's version information with PowerShell
v40_j_prefix	windows: reads the executable's version information with PowerShell
v40_k_only_product_version	windows: reads the executable's version information with PowerShell
v40_l_only_web	windows: reads the executable's version information with PowerShell
